<title>USA: Compositech ups shrs in stock award plan.</title>
<headline>Compositech ups shrs in stock award plan.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compositech Ltd said Tuesday that it authorized increasing the number of shares approved for issuance under its stock award plan.</p>
<p>The company said it increased the shares by 600,000.</p>
<p>A news release issued by the company gave no other details and no one from the company could be reached.</p>
</text>
